<title>UK: Deutsche Schiffsbank sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Schiffsbank sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SCHIFFSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **12.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S12.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BREMEN    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALL 12.NOV.97 AT PAR, WHEN COUPON STEPS UP TO 4.95</p>
<p>		PCT. S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
